#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:2
msgid "Implement a model adapter"
msgstr "实现模型适配器"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:4
msgid "Use a custom adapter for a new protocol or a deterministic test double. For an OpenAI-compatible HTTP service, first consider OpenAIProvider with a custom base_url; a new adapter may be unnecessary."
msgstr "遇到新协议，或者需要一个确定性的测试替身时，请使用自定义适配器。对于与 OpenAI 兼容的 HTTP 服务，先考虑用 OpenAIProvider 搭配自定义 base_url，可能并不需要新适配器。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:9
msgid "The protocol"
msgstr "协议"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:11
msgid ":class:`~zett_agent.model.AgentModel` accepts one fully assembled ModelRequest and returns an async iterator of ModelEvent. It has a model-owned RetryOptions policy. The protocol method is declared as a normal ``def`` returning AsyncIterator; an implementation may use ``async def`` with ``yield`` to satisfy that contract."
msgstr ":class:`~zett_agent.model.AgentModel`\\ 接收一个完整组装好的 ModelRequest，返回 ModelEvent 的异步迭代器。它带有一个由模型持有的 RetryOptions 策略。协议方法的声明是普通的 ``def``\\ ，返回 AsyncIterator；实现可以用 ``async def``\\ 加 ``yield``\\ 来满足这个契约。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:37
msgid "Required stream invariants"
msgstr "必须满足的流式约定"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:39
msgid "Yield zero or more text, reasoning, or tool-call fragments."
msgstr "产出零个或多个文本、推理或工具调用片段。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:40
msgid "End a successful stream with exactly one completed ModelResponse."
msgstr "成功的流式传输必须以恰好一个已完成的 ModelResponse 结束。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:41
msgid "Include the complete answer and complete ToolCalls in that response, even when they were also streamed as deltas. The runtime does not reconstruct the final message from display text."
msgstr "这个响应里要包含完整的回答和完整的 ToolCalls，即使它们已经作为增量流式传出。运行时不从展示文本重建最终消息。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:44
msgid "Do not emit anything after the final response."
msgstr "在最终响应之后不要再发出任何内容。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:45
msgid "Raise on transport/protocol failure; do not disguise failure as a successful empty answer."
msgstr "传输或协议失败时请抛出异常；不要把失败伪装成成功的空回答。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:47
msgid "ModelRequest contains the complete context for this step. Support the applicable message roles and typed image parts explicitly. AgentMessage is internal input, not assistant output; built-in adapters map it to user input for vendor APIs. Declare :attr:`~zett_agent.model.ModelRequest.cache_key` to the endpoint when its protocol caches prompt prefixes; the OpenAI adapter sends it as ``prompt_cache_key`` on both of its protocols."
msgstr "ModelRequest 包含这一步所需的完整上下文。请显式支持适用的消息角色和带类型的图像部分。AgentMessage 是内部输入，不是助手输出；内置适配器会把它映射成面向厂商 API 的用户输入。如果端点协议会缓存提示词前缀，请把\\ :attr:`~zett_agent.model.ModelRequest.cache_key`\\ 声明给它；OpenAI 适配器在它的两种协议上都会把它作为 ``prompt_cache_key``\\ 发送。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:55
msgid "Tool calls and usage"
msgstr "工具调用与用量"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:57
msgid "Use ToolCallDelta for partial ID/name/argument fragments and ToolCall for final parsed arguments. Correlate ToolMessage results by call ID, not list position. Report ModelUsage on the final response; input includes cache reads/writes and output includes reasoning when reported. Missing counters remain zero, but a protocol that reports no cache counters at all must pass ``cache_reported=False`` so callers can tell unknown cache usage from a measured miss."
msgstr "用 ToolCallDelta 表示 ID、名称或参数的部分片段，用 ToolCall 表示最终解析出的参数。工具结果请按调用 ID 关联到对应的 ToolMessage，而不是按列表位置。用量在最终响应上通过 ModelUsage 报告；输入包含缓存读取和写入，输出在模型提供商报告时包含推理。缺失的计数器保持为零，但如果某个协议完全不报告任何缓存计数器，就必须传入 ``cache_reported=False``，这样调用方才能区分未知的缓存用量和实测的未命中。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:65
msgid "Replay signed vendor blocks only for the same provider/model identity. Preserve them in AssistantMessage.replay_blocks instead of concatenating them into text."
msgstr "只对同一个提供商/模型标识重放签名的厂商块。请把它们保存在 AssistantMessage.replay_blocks 里，而不是拼接到文本中去。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:69
msgid "Retry policy belongs here"
msgstr "重试策略由这里负责"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:71
msgid "Retry transient failures only before an event escapes to the caller. Restarting after partial text or tool deltas would duplicate visible output and could confuse tool-call assembly. Validation/authentication failures should not be blindly retried. Close SDK streams in finally/context managers when the consumer stops early."
msgstr "只在一个事件逃逸给调用方之前重试瞬时失败。在部分文本或工具增量之后重启会重复可见输出，还可能干扰工具调用的组装。校验失败或认证失败不应盲目重试。当消费方提前停止时，请在 finally 或上下文管理器里关闭 SDK 流。"

#: ../../extending/model-adapter.rst:76
msgid "Run a test adapter: :doc:`../learn/first-agent`. Inspect built-in implementations under :doc:`../_generated/group-providers` for concrete vendor mappings."
msgstr "运行一个测试适配器：:doc:`../learn/first-agent`\\ 。各厂商的具体映射，可以查看\\ :doc:`../_generated/group-providers`\\ 下的内置实现。"

